7. FIRST LESSONS
==================================================

Initial A1 content should begin very simply.

LESSON 1:
Zahlen — German Numbers

Teach:

eins
zwei
drei
vier
fünf
sechs
sieben
acht
neun
zehn

Then gradually expand to larger numbers.

LESSON 2:
Das Alphabet

Teach the German alphabet and pronunciation.

A
B
C
D
...

Include pronunciation guidance where useful.

LESSON 3:
Listening / Number Recognition

The learner hears a German number or sequence and must enter the correct number.

A particularly important exercise:

PHONE NUMBER LISTENING

Example:

Audio:
"Null eins sieben drei ..."

The user must type the numerical combination.

Example expected answer:

0173...

This should train:

German listening
number recognition
conversion from spoken German to written numbers

This exercise system should eventually support randomized questions.

