9. CONVERSATIONAL GAME
==================================================

The main game concept is an interactive German conversation/story.

The player reads or listens to German dialogue.

The player can select responses.

Example:

NPC:
"Hallo! Wie heißt du?"

Choices:

A. "Ich heiße Anna."
B. "Ich bin zehn."
C. "Guten Morgen."

The selected response should influence the conversation where appropriate.

The story engine should be data-driven.

Do not hard-code every dialogue branch into individual screens.

Create a reusable conversation engine.

Future stories should be addable primarily by adding content rather than rewriting the engine.

