==================================================
13. ADMOB MONETIZATION
==================================================

Monetization is one of the primary goals of this application.

Use Google AdMob.

Create a dedicated advertising layer.

For example:

AdManager
AdRepository
Ad configuration

UI screens should NOT contain raw AdMob implementation everywhere.

The advertising system should be centralized.

Possible ad formats:

- Interstitial ads
- Rewarded ads
- Banner ads

Do NOT aggressively show ads.

Ads should be placed at natural breaks.

Possible locations:

After completing a lesson
Between chapters
After completing a story section
Before optional bonus content
For optional rewards

Rewarded ads should provide a meaningful optional benefit.

Example:

"Watch an ad to unlock the next bonus exercise."

Do NOT make users watch an ad after every interaction.

The goal is to maximize long-term revenue by maintaining user retention.

==================================================
14. ADMOB DEVELOPMENT SAFETY
==================================================

During development:

ALWAYS use AdMob test ads.

Never accidentally click production advertisements during testing.

Keep ad IDs/configuration separate from normal application logic.

Use placeholders or test IDs during development.

Before production release:

- configure production AdMob IDs
- verify app configuration
- verify ad behavior
- verify consent/privacy requirements
- verify Google Play requirements

Do not pretend production ad revenue exists during development.

==================================================
15. MONETIZATION STRATEGY
==================================================

The business objective is advertising revenue.

However:

Revenue =
Traffic × Retention × Sessions × Ad opportunities × eCPM

Therefore optimize for:

- useful learning
- repeat sessions
- short lessons
- replayable exercises
- natural story progression
- daily return behavior
- international discoverability

Do not sacrifice retention simply to display more advertisements.

